h2_0-0_s12 "H2 0-0 S(12)" H2 line 3.9947 nan nan "v=0-0 S(12)" "Roueff et al. 2019, A&A 630, A58 (H2 line list)" "para line; wavelength from Dabrowski-Herzberg tables, confirm against Roueff"
feii_24.519 "[Fe II] 24.519" FeII line 24.519 nan nan a4F5/2-a4F7/2 "NIST ASD (Kramida et al.); fine-structure lines" "completes the a4F ladder with 5.34/17.94"
hi_16-10 "H I 16-10" HI line 14.962 nan nan n=16-10 "Hydrogen recombination lines (vacuum), e.g. van Hoof 2018" "sits on the CO2 14.98 Q branch; common contaminant"
hei_1.083 "He I 1.083" HeI line 1.083 nan nan "2p 3P-2s 3S" "NIST ASD (Kramida et al.)" "accretion/wind tracer; He I 2.058 is the singlet analogue"
h2o_rot_mir "H2O pure rotational" H2O band nan 10.0 28.0 "pure rotational ladder" "Banzatti et al. 2023, 2025 (JWST-MIRI water excitation atlas and cold-water diagnostics)" "dense forest across all MRS channels; dominant disk coolant"
h2o_hot_17 "H2O hot diagnostic 17.0-17.6" H2O band nan 17.0 17.6 "high-Eu rotational blends" "Banzatti et al. 2023, 2025 (JWST-MIRI water excitation atlas and cold-water diagnostics)" "highest-S/N window for the hot component"
h2o_cold_23.9 "H2O cold diagnostic 23.8-24.0" H2O band nan 23.7 24.0 "low-Eu rotational pair" "Banzatti et al. 2023, 2025 (JWST-MIRI water excitation atlas and cold-water diagnostics)" "cold water near the snow line; Eu ~ 900-1800 K"
oh_prompt_9-13 "OH prompt rotational" OH band nan 9.1 13.0 "high-N rotational (prompt)" "Tabone et al. 2021 and Zannese et al. 2024 (OH prompt emission); Henning et al. 2024, PASP 136, 054302 (MINDS)" "band head 9.13; A'/A'' asymmetry traces H2O photodissociation"
oh_thermal_14-28 "OH thermal rotational" OH band nan 14.0 28.0 "rotational quadruplets" "Tabone et al. 2021 and Zannese et al. 2024 (OH prompt emission); Henning et al. 2024, PASP 136, 054302 (MINDS)" "more symmetric quadruplets than the prompt lines"
oh_rovib_3.4 "OH ro-vibrational" OH band nan 2.8 3.8 "dv=1 ro-vibrational" "Tabone et al. 2021 and Zannese et al. 2024 (OH prompt emission); Henning et al. 2024, PASP 136, 054302 (MINDS)" "NIRSpec; overlaps the 3 um H2O ice band"
ch4_7.65 "CH4 Q-branch" CH4 band 7.65 7.58 7.75 "nu4 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "overlaps the CH4 ice band at 7.67"
c2h4_10.53 "C2H4 Q-branch" C2H4 band 10.53 10.45 10.6 "nu7 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "inside the silicate band"
c2h6_12.17 "C2H6 Q-branch" C2H6 band 12.17 12.1 12.25 "nu9 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" ""
13cch2_13.73 "13CCH2 Q-branch" 13CCH2 band 13.73 13.7 13.78 "nu5 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "blended with the 12C2H2 Q branch; HITRAN data incomplete"
c6h6_14.85 "C6H6 Q-branch" C6H6 band 14.85 14.8 14.9 "nu4 Q (hot band)" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "benzene; can rival C2H2 in C/O > 1 disks"
hc3n_15.08 "HC3N Q-branch" HC3N band 15.08 15.02 15.14 "nu5 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "overlaps H2O rotational emission"
13co2_15.42 "13CO2 Q-branch (gas)" 13CO2 band 15.42 15.35 15.45 "nu2 Q" "Grant et al. 2023, ApJL 947, L6 (13CO2 in GW Lup); HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022)" "blended with the 12CO2 P(23) line"
c3h4_15.80 "C3H4 Q-branch" C3H4 band 15.8 15.74 15.86 "nu9 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "methyl acetylene"
c4h2_15.92 "C4H2 Q-branch" C4H2 band 15.92 15.86 15.96 "nu8 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "diacetylene; least affected by water of the rare C species"
co2_hot_16.18 "CO2 hot-band Q-branch" CO2 band 16.18 16.1 16.25 "nu2 hot band Q" "Grant et al. 2023, ApJL 947, L6 (13CO2 in GW Lup); HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022)" "column density diagnostic alongside the 14.98 Q branch"
ch3_16.48 "CH3 Q-branch" CH3 band 16.48 16.42 16.54 "nu2 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022); Tabone et al. 2023 and Arabhavi et al. 2024 (JWST/MIRI hydrocarbon-rich disks)" "single band only; spectroscopic data incomplete"
nh3_10.75 "NH3 gas Q-branch" NH3 band 10.75 10.65 10.85 "nu2 Q" "HITRAN2020 (Gordon et al. 2022)" "tentative in disks; inside the silicate band"
